DESCRIPTION:For a few weeks\, expansive energy meets your sense of home\, 
 comfort and self-worth (natal Venus in house 4)\, while stirring your worl
 d of partnerships and one-on-ones. You may feel tempted to overdo it — s
 pend more\, give more\, promise more to someone close — as growth and co
 nnection pull in different directions. It's not a crisis\, just friction b
 etween wanting more and staying grounded in what you truly value. Notice w
 here you're expanding for the right reasons versus just to please. → Ask
  yourself: am I growing this because it feels true\, or to keep the peace?
 \n\n— Technical detail: Jupiter within orb of square your Venus natal (h
 ouse 4) · exact: 16/09/26\n\n(until Sep 28)\n\n—\n✨ A product created
