UID:77f300de4a890c82d7bb5181@jentm1-arch.github.io/calendario-astral
DESCRIPTION:For about six weeks\, Venus moves backward through your house 
 of expansion and philosophy (house 9)\, inviting you to reconsider what yo
 u believe about love\, worth\, and generosity — especially around people
  from different backgrounds or bigger life journeys. Avoid finalizing big 
 romantic or financial decisions now\; instead\, revisit old conversations 
 or reconnect with values you may have abandoned while chasing something ne
 w. This is fertile ground for clarity\, not permanence. → What belief ab
 out love or money are you ready to update?\n\n— Technical detail: Venus 
 retrograde · 8°29' Scorpio → 22°51' Libra · house 9\n\n(until Nov 14
 )\n\n—\n✨ A product created by Soul Friendly\nhttps://mi-calendario-as
 tral.netlify.app
